{"diagnosis": "TRAP: cpu trap asserted with tohost FAIL 0xdead on 256-word NOP (ADDI x0,x0,0, funct3==000) stream, expected instr_addi asserted. picorv32.v:1057 uses `!= 3'b000` so ADDI never decodes and overlaps other ALU-imm decodes. CONE_SLICE only resolves picosoc/picosoc.v:146 cpu instantiation with no decoder refs, so trace+excerpt win.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -1057,3 +1057,3 @@
-			instr_addi  <= is_alu_reg_imm && mem_rdata_q[14:12] != 3'b000;
+			instr_addi  <= is_alu_reg_imm && mem_rdata_q[14:12] == 3'b000;
 			instr_slti  <= is_alu_reg_imm && mem_rdata_q[14:12] == 3'b010;
 			instr_sltiu <= is_alu_reg_imm && mem_rdata_q[14:12] == 3'b011;
", "expected": "tohost PASS with no TRAP: cpu trap asserted"}

